WEBVTT

00:06:24.760 --> 00:06:30.616
if what my team has already discovered
in the past few weeks are any indication,

00:06:30.640 --> 00:06:35.056
what the world discovers
is just going to be beyond imagination.

00:06:35.080 --> 00:06:38.136
Make sure to hold on to your alpacas.

00:06:38.160 --> 00:06:39.496
Thank you very much.

00:06:39.520 --> 00:06:41.336
(Applause)

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.576
Thank you.

00:06:42.600 --> 00:06:44.800
(Applause)